	// - into_blocks_dynamic splits the interior 1D domain into blocks of
	//   size tuning::block_size (last block may be smaller).
	// - hoist<'I'> makes the block index the outermost dimension.
	// - We use this only via traverser::order(...), so the states seen
	//   in the kernel still use the original 'i' index (neighbors stay
	//   at i-1 and i+1).
